msgid "The formula bar"
msgstr "Formellinjen"

#: src/control/onboarding/OnboardingSteps.ts:73
msgid ""
"The contents of the selected cell appear here. Type an equals sign to start "
"a formula."
msgstr ""
"Indholdet af den markerede celle vises her. Skriv et lighedstegn for at "
"starte en formel."

#: src/control/onboarding/OnboardingSteps.ts:80
msgid "The slide panel"
msgstr "Slidepanelet"

#: src/control/onboarding/OnboardingSteps.ts:82
msgid ""
"Every slide or page of the document is listed here. Select one to work on "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Alle dokumentets slides eller sider vises her. Vælg en slide eller en side "
"for at arbejde med den."

